{"overview":"زندگی مخفی، تنها چیزی است که آن‌ها مشترک دارند. در مدرسه، هوری، پرنده‌ی اجتماعی و بی‌نقص، در واقع یک خانه‌نشین خشن است. در حالی که زیر پوشش غم‌انگیز، میيامورا قلبی ملایم، همراه با گچ و تاتو، پنهان می‌کند. در یک ملاقات تصادفی، هر دو جنبه‌ای را که تا کنون نشان نداده‌اند، آشکار می‌کنند. آیا این می‌تواند به چیزی نو تبدیل شود؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"A secret life is the one thing they have in common. At school, Hori is a prim and perfect social butterfly, but the truth is she's a brash homebody. Meanwhile, under a gloomy facade, Miyamura hides a gentle heart, along with piercings and tattoos. In a chance meeting, they both reveal a side they've never shown. Could this blossom into something new?","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":13,"y":2021,"poster":"/qYZusFwAUcXso2i9tWSg2DFCxX5.jpg"}],"episodes":13,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"戸松遥","role":"Kyoko Hori (voice)","photo":"/geVvuA2zMGE5xzfc20aDelJSelu.jpg","en":"Haruka Tomatsu"},{"name":"内山昂輝","role":"Izumi Miyamura (voice)","photo":"/sllSm3iZZWVLTBrDZQRtWrZUfEj.jpg","en":"Koki Uchiyama"},{"name":"山下誠一郎","role":"Toru Ishikawa (voice)","photo":"/zym6WY3rxL4FdbHoLzG2CnqnR7.jpg","en":"Seiichiro Yamashita"},{"name":"小坂井祐莉絵","role":"Yuki Yoshikawa (voice)","photo":"/mbIMcptHLQir3wrAnnSSAR5uRR1.jpg","en":"Yurie Kozakai"},{"name":"岡本信彦","role":"Kakeru Sengoku (voice)","photo":"/7s1K2yQVF5iIWILaOfG7QrMZkXA.jpg","en":"Nobuhiko Okamoto"},{"name":"مائو ایچیمیچی","role":"Remi Ayasaki (voice)","photo":"/a3cflYtrlFK0LXfWODgLDO7E7CP.jpg","en":"Mao Ichimichi"},{"name":"近藤玲奈","role":"Sakura Kono (voice)","photo":"/yxxLyu5Ya8NftpY5NVR7uy1tzau.jpg","en":"Reina Kondo"},{"name":"دایکی یاماشیتا","role":"Shu Iura (voice)","photo":"/rQNdJdZewk7VGP16ZNbpfJ9ZeMd.jpg","en":"Daiki Yamashita"},{"name":"福山潤","role":"Akane Yanagi (voice)","photo":"/eT9eloyIaIkTvTqMmpcsAleP2hM.jpg","en":"Jun Fukuyama"},{"name":"八代拓","role":"Koichi Shindo (voice)","photo":"/e